      "blond": 8.0,
      "red": 8.0,
      "light_brown": 4.0
    },
    "_admixed_light_hair_skin_shift": "[D] skin L* added for light hair in admixed groups (latin, mixed origins): light hair comes with European ancestry (Ruiz-Linares et al. 2014, CANDELA)",
